      "explanation_html": "<div class=\"question q-prose\"><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><p> $\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\because ^{n}C_{r}+^{n}C_{r+1}=^{n+1}C_{r+1} \\\\ &amp; \\text{Given,}^{49}C_{3}+^{48}C_{3}+^{47}C_{3}+^{46}C_{3}+^{45}C_{3}+^{45}C_{4} \\\\ &amp; \\\\ &amp; =^{49}C_{3}+^{48}C_{3}+^{47}C_{3}+^{46}C_{3}+^{46}C_{4} \\end{aligned}$ </p>\n<p> $\\begin{aligned} &amp; =^{49}C_{3}+^{48}C_{3}+^{47}C_{3}+^{47}C_{4} \\\\ &amp; =^{49}C_{3}+^{48}C_{3}+^{48}C_{4} \\\\ &amp; =^{49}C_{3}+^{49}C_{4}=^{50}C_{4} \\end{aligned}$ </p><!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div>",
